---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Vaani"
  description="Terms of Service for Vaani - Read our terms governing access to and use of our services."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="section-container py-20 md:py-28">
    <article class="prose prose-invert mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-accent-blue">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Welcome to <strong class="text-text-primary">Shruti Vaani Labs</strong> ("we", "our", or "us").
        These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of our website, mobile applications, and related products and services (collectively, the "Service").
        By accessing or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Service.
      </p>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">1. Eligibility</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          You must be at least <strong class="text-text-primary">13 years old</strong> (or the minimum legal age in your jurisdiction) to use the Service. By using the Service, you confirm that you meet this requirement and have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">2. Account Registration</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">Some features may require you to create an account. You agree to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>Provide accurate and complete information</li>
          <li>Keep your login credentials secure</li>
          <li>Be responsible for all activity under your account</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          You must notify us immediately if you believe your account has been compromised.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">You agree to use the Service only for lawful purposes.</p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">You must <strong class="text-text-primary">not</strong>:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Attempt unauthorized access to systems or data</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Service</li>
          <li>Upload malicious code, viruses, or harmful content</li>
          <li>Abuse, harass, or harm other users</li>
          <li>Misuse the Service in a way that causes harm or legal risk</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate access for violations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">4. AI-Powered Features</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Some features of the Service may use <strong class="text-text-primary">artificial intelligence or machine learning models</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">By using such features, you understand and agree that:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>AI-generated outputs may not always be accurate or complete</li>
          <li>Outputs are provided for <strong class="text-text-primary">informational or assistive purposes only</strong></li>
          <li>You are responsible for how you use AI-generated results</li>
          <li>AI outputs should not be relied upon as professional, legal, medical, or financial advice</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          We continuously work to improve accuracy and safety but do not guarantee correctness.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">5. User Content</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">If you submit content (such as text, images, files, or data):</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>You retain ownership of your content</li>
          <li>You grant us a <strong class="text-text-primary">non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license</strong> to use, store, process, and display it solely to operate and improve the Service</li>
          <li>You confirm that you have the right to submit such content</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          You are solely responsible for the content you provide.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">6. Payments and Subscriptions</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">If the Service includes paid features or subscriptions:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>Prices and billing terms are shown before purchase</li>
          <li>Payments are processed by third-party payment providers</li>
          <li>Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled</li>
          <li>Refunds are subject to the platform's policies (Google Play / Apple App Store)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          We may update pricing with prior notice where required by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">
          All software, designs, logos, trademarks, and content provided by the Service are owned by <strong class="text-text-primary">Shruti Vaani Labs</strong> or its licensors.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">You may not:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>Copy, modify, distribute, or reverse engineer the Service</li>
          <li>Use our branding without written permission</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          All rights not expressly granted are reserved.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">8. Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Your use of the Service is governed by our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors underline">Privacy Policy</a>, which explains how we collect, use, and protect your data. By using the Service, you agree to the practices described in the Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">9. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          The Service may link to or integrate with third-party services. We do not control and are not responsible for their content, policies, or practices. Your use of third-party services is at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">10. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">
          The Service is provided <strong class="text-text-primary">"as is"</strong> and <strong class="text-text-primary">"as available"</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">To the maximum extent permitted by law, we disclaim all warranties, including implied warranties of:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>Merchantability</li>
          <li>Fitness for a particular purpose</li>
          <li>Accuracy or reliability</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, <strong class="text-text-primary">Shruti Vaani Labs</strong> shall not be liable for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>Indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages</li>
          <li>Loss of data, profits, or business opportunities</li>
          <li>Issues arising from misuse of the Service or AI outputs</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          Your sole remedy is to stop using the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">12. Termination</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-3">We may suspend or terminate your access at any time if:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-text-secondary space-y-2">
          <li>You violate these Terms</li>
          <li>Required by law or platform policies</li>
          <li>The Service is discontinued</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          Upon termination, your right to use the Service immediately ends.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          We may update these Terms from time to time. Changes will be posted with an updated date. Continued use of the Service means you accept the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">14. Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          These Terms are governed by the laws of <strong class="text-text-primary">India</strong>, without regard to conflict of law principles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">15. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at:
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-3">
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Shruti Vaani Labs</strong><br />
          <a href="mailto:ajaymourya9971@gmail.com" class="text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors underline">ajaymourya9971@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
